s and Elite only)'),'plus'=>array('Regenerate download permissions'),'elite'=>array('Regenerate download permissions'))),array('group'=>'returns--accepted-task','module'=>'returns','label'=>'Continue with Set a return window','consequence'=>'Policy examples illustrate elapsed windows, not current real-order eligibility. Undo restores compatible configuration, not return decisions, notifications, refunds or stock.','context'=>'Continue using Set a return window. Review its current checks and saved choices; this help does not replace the task or reset its history.','routes'=>array('free'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns-job'),'plus'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns-job'),'elite'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns-job')),'guide'=>'https://booster.io/docs/woocommerce-return-requests/#booster-v10-s20-returns-accepted-task','placement'=>'context','members'=>array('free'=>array('return window','notification choice','Elite supported item rule','review','Apply','saved receipt','compatible Undo'),'plus'=>array('return window','notification choice','Elite supported item rule','review','Apply','saved receipt','compatible Undo'),'elite'=>array('return window','notification choice','Elite supported item rule','review','Apply','saved receipt','compatible Undo'))),array('group'=>'returns--customer-request','module'=>'returns','label'=>'Understand a customer return request','consequence'=>'A saved request reserves eligible quantities. A request or approval does not refund payment or restock goods.','context'=>'The signed-in customer must own an eligible order. Check the current return window and item eligibility before submitting a real request. A request reserves its applicable quantity; it is not a refund.','routes'=>array('free'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-plugins&wcj-cat=shipping_and_orders&section=returns'),'plus'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-plugins&wcj-cat=shipping_and_orders&section=returns'),'elite'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-plugins&wcj-cat=shipping_and_orders&section=returns')),'guide'=>'https://booster.io/docs/woocommerce-return-requests/#booster-v10-s20-returns-customer-request','placement'=>'context','members'=>array('free'=>array('item quantities','reason','Submit return request','history','cancel','older requests'),'plus'=>array('item quantities','reason','Submit return request','history','cancel','older requests'),'elite'=>array('item quantities','reason','Submit return request','history','cancel','older requests'))),array('group'=>'returns--queue-decisions','module'=>'returns','label'=>'Review requests and decide separately from refunds','consequence'=>'Changed facts can hold claims and block approval. A decision is not a refund, stock change or permission to retry an unknown outcome.','context'=>'Open the request, review its current facts and choose a decision deliberately. If the request changed, reload before acting. Handle payment refunds and stock adjustments separately.','routes'=>array('free'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns'),'plus'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns'),'elite'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns')),'guide'=>'https://booster.io/docs/woocommerce-return-requests/#booster-v10-s20-returns-queue-decisions','placement'=>'context','members'=>array('free'=>array('pending request history','approve','decline','cancel','older requests','current-facts warnings'),'plus'=>array('pending request history','approve','decline','cancel','older requests','current-facts warnings'),'elite'=>array('pending request history','approve','decline','cancel','older requests','current-facts warnings'))),array('group'=>'returns--storage-dispatch','module'=>'returns','label'=>'Keep storage setup and notification dispatch explicit','consequence'=>'Opening guidance creates no storage and sends no mail. Dispatch is deliberate; unknown delivery is not safely resendable.','context'=>'Use the existing storage setup and notification controls deliberately. A saved notification intent does not prove delivery. Review failed or pending messages before retrying; do not send duplicate customer messages.','routes'=>array('free'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns'),'plus'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns'),'elite'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns')),'guide'=>'https://booster.io/docs/woocommerce-return-requests/#booster-v10-s20-returns-storage-dispatch','placement'=>'context','members'=>array('free'=>array('Set up request storage','Set up or repair guest verification storage','Dispatch notification','Notification request status'),'plus'=>array('Set up request storage','Set up or repair guest verification storage','Dispatch notification','Notification request status'),'elite'=>array('Set up request storage','Set up or repair guest verification storage','Dispatch notification','Notification request status'))),array('group'=>'returns--guest-flow','module'=>'returns','label'=>'Understand guest verification and private return history','consequence'=>'Verification consent and return-status notification consent are independent. Page configuration does not prove email delivery or access readiness.','context'=>'Use a published page containing [wcj_returns_guest] only after enabling guest returns and completing secure storage setup. Keep HTTPS and private, uncached verification. Never publish customer verification links or keys.','routes'=>array('free'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-plugins&wcj-cat=shipping_and_orders&section=returns'),'plus'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-plugins&wcj-cat=shipping_and_orders&section=returns'),'elite'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-plugins&wcj-cat=shipping_and_orders&section=returns')),'guide'=>'https://booster.io/docs/woocommerce-return-requests/#booster-v10-s20-returns-guest-flow','placement'=>'context','members'=>array('free'=>array('order/email challenge','verification code','quantities','reason','submit','cancel','private history'),'plus'=>array('order/email challenge','verification code','quantities','reason','submit','cancel','private history'),'elite'=>array('order/email challenge','verification code','quantities','reason','submit','cancel','private history'))),array('group'=>'returns--queue-insights','module'=>'returns','label'=>'Use Returns queue filters and reports','consequence'=>'The reports describe the displayed request page, not the whole store. Missing information is not zero. Matching reason text does not necessarily mean customers had the same intent.','context'=>'Elite reports cover only the current page, up to 50 requests, not the whole store history. Requests can change while you work. Use the filters to find requests, then open each request to check its latest details before deciding.','routes'=>array('elite'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns')),'guide'=>'https://booster.io/docs/woocommerce-return-requests/#booster-v10-s20-returns-queue-insights','placement'=>'context','members'=>array('elite'=>array('Request status','Exact order ID','Filter requests','Reset filters','pending age','exact submitted reason','overlap warning'))),array('group'=>'returns--workflow-exercise','module'=>'returns','label'=>'Practice the existing Elite Returns workflow','consequence'=>'Each practice run is retained privately; it is not removed automatically. If its result is uncertain, reload that same run rather than creating another one.','context'=>'Elite\'s existing private practice workflow uses synthetic records, not real customer requests. Keep it separate from the customer queue; do not treat an exercise result as a refund or delivery.','routes'=>array('elite'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns&wcj_returns_view=synthetic')),'guide'=>'https://booster.io/docs/woocommerce-return-requests/#booster-v10-s20-returns-workflow-exercise','placement'=>'context','members'=>array('elite'=>array('Practice quantity','Original practice run reference','Create practice run','Decision','Read-only recovery'))),array('group'=>'returns--summary','module'=>'returns','label'=>'Read the existing Returns summary carefully','consequence'=>'This is a read-only sample by request ID, not full-store totals or most recently updated requests. Approval counts are not refunds or restocks.','context'=>'Read the existing Returns summary alongside the current queue. It explains the available state but is not a refund, stock or message-delivery confirmation.','routes'=>array('free'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns-summary'),'plus'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns-summary'),'elite'=>array('admin.php?page=wcj-returns-summary')),'guide'=>'https://booster.io/docs/woocommerce-return-requests/#booster-v10-s20-returns-summary','placement'=>'context','members'=>array('free'=>array('Requests sampled (up to 50)','Counts by status','Unknown or unavailable information'),'plus'=>array('Requests sampled (up to 50)','Counts by status','Unknown or unavailable information'),'elite'=>array('Requests sampled (up to 50)','Counts by status','Unknown or unavailable information'))));}
 public static function modules(){return array('max_products_per_user'=>array('Maximum Products per User','Purchase restrictions','Limit repeat purchases by signed-in customers using recorded purchases and their cart. Guests are not limited by this module.','The global limit is available in every edition. Per-product limits require Plus or Elite. Recalculating purchase history writes records and order markers; it is not a reset.'),'order_min_amount'=>array('Order Minimum Amount','Purchase restrictions','Choose the amount that counts toward a minimum, any role-specific amount, and the notices or checkout redirect. Shipping, tax, discounts and currency settings can change the comparison.','Free keeps the default message and limits some role and compatibility fields. Plus and Elite expose those choices. A locked field is not a guarantee that an older saved value has no effect.'),'order_quantities'=>array('Order Quantities','Purchase restrictions','Set cart totals, item quantities and increments separately. Product overrides, variations and validation choices can change which limit applies.','Free supports cart-total limits and the available input choices. Plus and Elite add per-item and per-product controls. Fixed quantities are available only in Elite. Check the actual product and checkout format you use.'),'order_custom_statuses'=>array('Order Custom Statuses','Statuses','Name and expose statuses, choose defaults and decide where staff can act on orders. A status change can send emails or trigger other plugins.','Free can add and delete definitions but its Edit link and some action/color choices are locked. Plus and Elite expose the paid controls. A status called Refunded does not establish that money was returned.'),'order_numbers'=>array('Order Numbers','Order numbers and records','Choose numbering and display separately. Formatting can change numbers shown for older orders; changing a counter or renumbering stored orders has different effects.','Free includes sequential choices, a custom prefix and renumbering. Plus and Elite add the locked format and order-editor choices. Transaction settings alone are not a uniqueness guarantee.'),'orders'=>array('Orders','Order numbers and records','Choose staff order tools, automatic completion and download-access operations. These can change order records, statuses or customer permissions, not merely their appearance.','Free has currency, navigation, IP-country and automatic-completion choices without payment-method restriction. Plus and Elite add payment-method restrictions and download regeneration. Free cannot turn editable-order settings On here, but previously enabled choices can still apply; check which orders are editable.'),'my_account'=>array('My Account','Customer account page','Change account wording, navigation and content separately from customer order actions and registration roles. Offering a role at registration can grant that role to a new customer.','Menu labels are editable in every edition. Free allows one custom page and one information block. Plus and Elite add menu reordering, custom links, more pages/blocks and endpoint editing.'),'returns'=>array('Returns','Returns','Keep the existing return-window task, request queue and customer verification flow. A decision about a return request does not itself refund payment or restock goods.','Free and Plus keep the storewide window and basic request flow. Elite adds item-policy overrides and its queue reports and workflow exercise. Existing guest setup and storage requirements still apply.'));}
 public static function url(){return admin_url('admin.php?page=wcj-order-account-tasks');}
 public static function allowed($id){$core=WCJ_Job_Store::core();return current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')&&WCJ_Task_Finder::allowed($id)&&$core&&isset($core->all_modules[$id]);}
 private static function link($url,$label){return '<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="'.esc_url($url).'">'.esc_html($label.' (new tab)').'</a>';}
 public static function render($module='',$selected=array()){
  $ed=WCJ_Account_Orders_Label_Job::edition();$items=array_filter(self::groups(),static function($g)use($module,$selected,$ed){return (!$module||$module===$g['module'])&&(!$selected||in_array($g['group'],$selected,true))&&isset($g['routes'][$ed])&&self::allowed($g['module']);});
  if(!$items){return;}
  echo '<details class="wcj-order-account-groups"><summary>Orders and customer accounts: settings and help</summary><p>Help and full settings open in a new tab, leaving your draft here. Save any changes there before deliberately reloading this page. Reading this help does not change an order, assign a role or submit a return request.</p><ul>';
  foreach($items as $g){echo '<li data-order-account-group="'.esc_attr($g['group']).'"><h4>'.esc_html($g['label']).'</h4><p>'.esc_html($g['consequence']).'</p><p>'.esc_html($g['context']).'</p><p>';
   foreach(array_unique($g['routes'][$ed]) as $route){if(0===strpos($route,'admin.php?')){echo self::link(admin_url($route),'Full settings: '.$g['label']).' | ';}}
   echo self::link($g['guide'],'Help: '.$g['label']).'</p>';
   if('product_or_order_editor'===$g['placement']){echo '<p>Choose the intended existing product or order in its WooCommerce list. The fields shown depend on the enabled section, edition and editor.</p>';}
   if($g['members'][$ed]){echo '<details><summary>Controls and information for '.esc_html(ucfirst($ed)).'</summary><ul>';foreach($g['members'][$ed] as $label){echo '<li>'.esc_html($label).'</li>';}echo '</ul><p>Some controls appear after saving a count or enabling a section. Full settings retain your edition limits and account permissions.</p></details>';}
   echo '</li>';
  }echo '</ul></details>';
 }
 public static function entry(){if(current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')){echo '<p><a href="'.esc_url(self::url()).'">Orders and customer accounts: choose what to change</a></p>';}}
 public static function register(){if(current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')){add_submenu_page('woocommerce','Orders and customer accounts','Orders and accounts','manage_woocommerce','wcj-order-account-tasks',array(__CLASS__,'hub'));}}
 public static function hub(){
  if(!current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')){wp_die(esc_html__('Ask an administrator for access.','woocommerce-jetpack'));}
  wp_enqueue_style('wcj-account-orders-label-job',wcj_plugin_url().'/assets/css/admin/wcj-account-orders-label-job.css',array(),'1.0');
  echo '<div class="wrap wcj-order-account-hub"><h1>Manage orders and customer accounts</h1><p>Choose the result you need. Purchase limits, order statuses, numbering, account wording and return decisions have different effects. Keep consequential changes in their full settings.</p>';
  if(self::allowed('my_account')){echo '<p><a class="button button-primary" href="'.esc_url(WCJ_Account_Orders_Label_Job::url()).'">Rename Orders in My Account</a></p>';}
  if(self::allowed('returns')){echo '<p>'.self::link(admin_url('admin.php?page=wcj-returns-job'),'Set a return window: existing task').'</p>';}
  foreach(array('Purchase restrictions','Statuses','Order numbers and records','Customer account page','Returns') as $lane){echo '<section><h2>'.esc_html($lane).'</h2>';foreach(self::modules() as $id=>$m){if($m[1]!==$lane||!self::allowed($id)){continue;}$s=WCJ_Job_Store::read_state('wcj_'.$id.'_enabled');$flag=!$s['exists']?'Off (not switched on)':('yes'===$s['raw']?'On':('no'===$s['raw']?'Off':'Unrecognized saved value'));echo '<div data-order-account-module="'.esc_attr($id).'"><h3>'.esc_html($m[0]).'</h3><p>'.esc_html($m[2]).'</p><p>'.esc_html($m[3]).'</p><p>'.esc_html('Saved module switch: '.$flag.'. Saving choices does not itself enable the module.').'</p>';self::render($id);echo '</div>';}echo '</section>';}
  echo '<details><summary>Switching off, resetting and recovery</summary><p>Use full settings to change module switches. Record your current choices before Reset: it removes module settings, not just the last edit. Switching off does not undo changed order statuses, numbers, permissions, assigned roles or return decisions. Keep a recoverable backup before bulk operations. The Orders label task can only undo its own latest eligible label change.</p></details></div>';
 }
 public static function boxes($type,$post){
  if(!current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')||!is_object($post)||!isset($post->ID)||!current_user_can('edit_post',$post->ID)){return;}
  if('product'===$type&&(self::allowed('max_products_per_user')||self::allowed('order_quantities'))){add_meta_box('wcj-order-account-product-help','Purchase limits: help and consequences',array(__CLASS__,'product_help'),'product','normal','low');}
  if('shop_order'===$type&&(self::allowed('order_numbers')||self::allowed('orders'))){add_meta_box('wcj-order-account-order-help','Order numbers and records: help',array(__CLASS__,'order_help'),'shop_order','normal','low');}
 }
 public static function product_help($post){if(current_user_can('edit_post',$post->ID)){self::render('',array('max_products_per_user--product-limit','max_products_per_user--purchase-record','order_quantities--product-limits','order_quantities--product-fixed','order_quantities--product-step'));}}
 public static function order_help($post){if(current_user_can('edit_post',$post->ID)){self::render('',array('order_numbers--order-editor','orders--order-currency','orders--order-navigation-ip','order_custom_statuses--order-actions'));}}
 public static function screen_help(){
  if(!current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')||!isset($_GET['page'])||!is_string($_GET['page'])){return;}$page=$_GET['page'];$tab=isset($_GET['tab'])&&is_string($_GET['tab'])?$_GET['tab']:'';
  if('wcj-tools'===$page&&'custom_statuses'===$tab){self::render('order_custom_statuses',array('order_custom_statuses--definition-editor','order_custom_statuses--definition-delete'));}
  elseif('wcj-tools'===$page&&'renumerate_orders'===$tab){self::render('order_numbers',array('order_numbers--renumeration','order_numbers--renumerate-action'));}
  elseif('wc-orders'===$page){self::render('',array('order_numbers--order-editor','orders--order-currency','orders--order-navigation-ip','orders--download-action','order_custom_statuses--order-actions'));}
  elseif(in_array($page,array('wcj-returns','wcj-returns-job','wcj-returns-summary'),true)){self::render('returns');}
 }
}
add_action('admin_menu',array('WCJ_Order_Account_Groups','register'),99);
add_action('add_meta_boxes',array('WCJ_Order_Account_Groups','boxes'),40,2);
add_action('admin_notices',array('WCJ_Order_Account_Groups','screen_help'),40);
